# Use local file: .env.netlify
#
# On Netlify, set ALL keys from .env.netlify.
# Critical Admin pair:
#   FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL
#   FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY_BASE64   ← prefer this (no newline paste issues)
#
# Remove:
#   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH
#   FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY          (old broken paste)
#   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON
#
# Then check:
#   https://vero360.app/api/admin/health
#   https://vero360.app/api/admin/health?probe=1

